# Environment files
#
# NOTE: .env itself is deliberately left TRACKED. Lovable Cloud generates it and
# it holds only public VITE_* values (project URL + anon publishable key), which
# Vite inlines into the client bundle anyway. Untracking it risks breaking the
# Lovable build, so it stays.
#
# These rules exist so that any OTHER env file - a local override, a scratch
# copy, anything holding a service_role or third-party key - can never reach
# this repo, which is public.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
